        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagano lya magazi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Liini mwize ku' wanne, ev'e, Aloni, Nadabu na Abihu, haki'mo na v'anamala maku'mi mupungati' mugati' na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli. Mwi'me katanalo na ku'nku'v'i'i'la. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi ev'e Mose winene du' hu' u'ku'negela bi'hi', sumbwa v'angi' ku'du' v'anegele, ninga V'aizilaeli ku'du' v'aliine haki'mo nanho.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wayaga ku'kav'awi'la v'antu' mihayo na milagi' zyose zyamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu. V'antu' v'ose v'asu'v'yaga ku' muzwi gu'mo na ku'yomba ati', “Ki'la muhayo u'go walagi'li'zyaga Gu'ku' Mulungu, ku'ku'v'ezya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose watonaga ki'la muhayo u'go Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga. Hangi' wangalu'ke ndiyu', wipunaga na ku'zyenga ihozezyo ha nsi'li'li' na lu'gu'lu', na ku'ki'ndi'ka nhi'ngi' iku'mi na iv'i'li' zya mawe ku'londana na lu'v'alo lwa magongo iku'mi na av'i'li' ga V'aizilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene wav'atu'maga v'asu'mbana v'a Ki'izilaeli, ki'gele v'amufumi'zye Gu'ku' Mulungu vitaambo vya ku'zigya na vitaambo vya kwiswanania vya ng'ombe nzagamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe Mose wasolaga nusu ya magazi ga vitaambo vyeni'vyo, wagatu'u'laga mu mabakuli, na gangi' wanyanyagi'laga ha ihozezyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' wasolaga Ki'tabu cha Ilagano na waki'somaga ha mbele ya v'antu' v'ose, nav'o v'ayombaga ati', “Mihayo zyose i'zyo wayombaga Gu'ku' Mulungu ku'ku'ziv'ezya, na ku'ku'muku'zya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Mose wagasolaga ago magazi, na ku'v'anyanyagi'la v'antu' v'enav'o. Wayombaga, “Genaga hu' magazi ga ilagano i'lo Gu'ku' Mulungu wav'ezyaga na inywe ku'londana na mihayo zyeni'zi zyose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose, Aloni, Nadabu na Abihu, haki'mo na v'anamala maku'mi mupungati' mugati' na v'anamala v'a Izilaeli, v'aliinaga ku' lu'gu'lu', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nav'o v'amuwonaga Mulungu wa Izilaeli. Ha nsi'li'li' na magu'lu' gakwe hav'age na ki'ntu' i'cho ki'li' ki'ti' ilole i'lo li'v'eziv'ilwe ku' mawe ga yakuti ya samawati, i'lo li'li' isoso ki'ti' chelela cha ilunde. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi Gu'ku' Mulungu akawu'sizye mukono gwakwe ha igu'lya na v'atongelezi v'a V'aizilaeli. Sumbwa v'amuwonaga Mulungu, nav'o v'alyaga na ku'nywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mose ali'liina ku' lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho Gu'ku' Mulungu wamuwi'laga Mose ati', “Liina ku' igu'lya wize ku'no ku' wanne, wikale ku'no. Nanne nku'ku'pa mav'ale ga mawe ago gatonilwe nhama na nzi'la ya nhana, ki'gele u'kav'ahembeke V'aizilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wawu'kaga haki'mo na Yoswa, mukumba wakwe, nawe Mose walamulaga ku'liina ku' lu'gu'lu' lwamwa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose wasangwa wav'awi'laga av'o v'anamala v'a Izilaeli ati', “Ku'lindi'li henanha mpaka aho ku'ku'v'a kwasu'v'a. U'lu' muntu' wav'a na igambo aku'v'a ali'ya ku'mwa Aloni na Huli, ku'nguno v'enav'a v'aku'v'a haki'mo na inywe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene Mose wendeleyaga ku'liina ku' lu'gu'lu', na ilunde lyalu'kumbaga lu'gu'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwasookaga ha igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' lwa Sinai, na ilunde lyalu'kumbaga lu'gu'lu' nsiku' mukaga. Mu lu'siku' lwa mupungati' Mulungu wamwitanaga Mose ku'fuma mugati' na ilunde lyeni'lo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lu'kumo lwamwa Gu'ku' Mulungu lwigelaga ha mbele ya minso ga V'aizilaeli ki'ti' moto gwa ku'zigya kwenu'ko ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Mose wafiki'ki'laga na kwingi'la mugati' na ilunde lyeni'lo. Nawe wikalaga kwenu'ko ku' igu'lya na lu'gu'lu' ku' itungo lya nsiku' maku'mi ane, wu'ziku' na lyu'v'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
